Sa yakitori, alin ang mas gusto mo, asin o sarsa?

181
00:09:49,325 --> 00:09:53,858
Gusto ko ang matamis na sarsa.

182
00:09:53,881 --> 00:09:57,814
Gusto ko ang maanghang na asin.

183
00:09:57,837 --> 00:10:02,304
Eh, mag-order na tayo ng assortment?

184
00:10:02,327 --> 00:10:06,694
Sa assortment, merong dalawa eh.

185
00:10:06,717 --> 00:10:11,328
Pwede kang mag-order ng parehong asin at sarsa.

186
00:10:11,352 --> 00:10:14,231
Magandang ideya iyon.

187
00:10:14,255 --> 00:10:18,388
Mag-order din tayo ng isang plato ng fried chicken?

188
00:10:18,411 --> 00:10:20,445
Maganda 'yan.

189
00:10:20,468 --> 00:10:23,305
Kainin natin pareho.

190
00:10:23,328 --> 00:10:25,895
Kaya mo ba lahat 'yan?

191
00:10:25,918 --> 00:10:29,851
Baka masyadong marami.

192
00:10:29,874 --> 00:10:33,508
Okay lang ako, gutom na gutom ako eh.

193
00:10:33,531 --> 00:10:36,864
Mag-order din tayo ng salad.

194
00:10:36,887 --> 00:10:39,720
Paano ang Caesar salad?

195
00:10:39,743 --> 00:10:42,230
Sobrang gusto ko iyon!

196
00:10:42,254 --> 00:10:44,550
Sige, iyon na nga.

197
00:10:44,573 --> 00:10:47,858
Ang tofu salad din ay masarap.

198
00:10:47,881 --> 00:10:51,948
Ngayon, Caesar salad na lang muna tayo, ha?

199
00:10:51,971 --> 00:10:54,145
Sige, okay lang.

200
00:10:54,169 --> 00:10:56,602
Sige, ganoon na nga.

201
00:10:56,625 --> 00:10:59,958
Ang sashimi assortment din ay maganda.

202
00:10:59,981 --> 00:11:04,434
Mayroong recommended na isda ngayon.

203
00:11:04,457 --> 00:11:08,824
Mag-order na tayo ng lahat, isda at karne?

204
00:11:08,847 --> 00:11:13,023
Mas mabuti siguro kung unti-unti lang ang order.

205
00:11:13,047 --> 00:11:14,680
Tama po.

206
00:11:14,703 --> 00:11:17,757
Muna tayo sa karne at salad.

207
00:11:17,781 --> 00:11:19,347
Sige po.

208
00:11:19,370 --> 00:11:22,137
Tawagin natin ang waiter.

209
