Galing lang po sa daungan ngayong umaga.

219
00:11:56,868 --> 00:11:59,901
Napakaganda naman.

220
00:11:59,924 --> 00:12:02,157
Isa na po.

221
00:12:02,180 --> 00:12:03,780
Maraming salamat po.

222
00:12:03,803 --> 00:12:06,437
Sashimi assortment po.

223
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:10,026
May iba pa bang paboritong pulutan dito?

224
